    <string name="consent_disclaimer_title">What this app cannot do</string>
    <string name="consent_disclaimer_body">This app cannot prove the scene itself was real, cannot make evidence automatically admissible in court, and cannot defeat a determined attacker with a rooted device and specialised equipment. It makes tampering cryptographically detectable and timestamps what your device captured.</string>

